!Energetic Window in eV relative to the Fermi Level
COHPstartEnergy -20
COHPendEnergy 5

usebasisset pbeVaspFit2015 

!The valence orbitals to be used
basisFunctions Bi 6s 6p 5d
basisFunctions O 2p 2s
basisFunctions Cl 3p 3s

!Pairs for the COHP Analysis (numbered atoms as in the POSCAR)
!cohpbetween atom x and atom y
 cohpGenerator from 0.5 to 3.7 type Cl type Cl
 cohpGenerator from 0.5 to 3.5 type Bi type O
 cohpGenerator from 0.5 to 3.5 type Bi type Cl

